  "scope": "Standard UART, HP I2C, standard SPI master, LEDC channels, ADC1, RMT channels and I2S master only; LP controllers excluded. RMT TX/RX direction is not enforced (C6 channels 0-1 are TX-only and 2-3 RX-only).",
  "peripherals": [
